          <h3 style="font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
            <span class="glow-word">Instagram</span>
          </h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #C2BCB0;">
